{"chars": "Blitzen lowered her head. Her hooves began to tingle, tickle-tickle-tickle, like snowflakes landing on her toes. The tingle rose up through her legs and along her back, all the way to the tips of her shining antlers. And then, softly at first, her hooves began to click. Click. Click-click. Click-click-click, faster and faster, like a drumroll, until they were clicking in the very same rhythm as the hooves of every reindeer around her.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 0.675, 1.012, 1.012, 1.012, 1.012, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.7, 1.8, 1.8, 1.8, 1.8, 1.95, 1.95, 1.95, 1.95, 1.95, 1.95, 1.95, 2.275, 2.275, 2.275, 2.275, 2.275, 2.275, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.763, 2.763, 2.763, 2.763, 2.763, 2.763, 2.763, 3.275, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 4.3, 4.375, 4.375, 4.375, 4.375, 4.375, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.638, 5.638, 5.638, 5.737, 5.737, 5.737, 5.737, 5.875, 5.875, 5.875, 5.875, 5.875, 6.75, 6.85, 6.85, 6.85, 6.85, 6.95, 6.95, 6.95, 6.95, 6.95, 6.95, 6.95, 7.325, 7.325, 7.325, 7.325, 7.325, 7.588, 7.588, 7.588, 7.775, 7.775, 7.775, 7.775, 7.775, 7.775, 7.775, 7.775, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.125, 8.588, 8.588, 8.588, 8.588, 8.725, 8.725, 8.725, 8.725, 8.725, 8.725, 8.988, 8.988, 8.988, 8.988, 9.1, 9.1, 9.1, 9.1, 9.1, 9.55, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 9.838, 9.838, 9.838, 9.838, 9.925, 9.925, 9.925, 9.925, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.287, 10.412, 10.412, 10.412, 10.412, 10.412, 10.688, 10.688, 10.688, 10.762, 10.762, 10.762, 10.762, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 10.912, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 11.312, 12.225, 12.325, 12.325, 12.325, 12.325, 12.463, 12.463, 12.463, 12.463, 12.463, 12.7, 